ghcr.io/thaynes43/comfyui - license notice
==========================================

This image bundles ComfyUI @COMFYUI_VERSION@, which is free software licensed
under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (GPL-3.0).

  Project:        ComfyUI
  Version:        @COMFYUI_VERSION@
  Copyright:      the ComfyUI authors
  Source (exact): https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/tree/@COMFYUI_VERSION@
  Source archive: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/archive/refs/tags/@COMFYUI_VERSION@.tar.gz

The full license text is in /usr/share/doc/comfyui/LICENSE (the same file ships
in the source tree at /opt/ComfyUI/LICENSE).

ComfyUI is installed unmodified, in source form, at /opt/ComfyUI. It is the
upstream tag above with only its .git, .github, .ci, tests and tests-unit
directories removed. The image's own entrypoint and provisioning scripts are in
/opt/comfyui-tools and are built from
https://github.com/thaynes43/haynes-ops/tree/main/scripts/comfyui .

The Python packages installed in the image (PyTorch, NumPy and others) are
separate works under their own licenses. Each one's license files are in its
.dist-info directory under the Python site-packages directory, and its exact
version is pinned in constraints.txt next to the Dockerfile. The base image and
its Debian packages keep their copyright files under /usr/share/doc/*/copyright.
